    {
      "id": "text-001",
      "type": "text",
      "source": "ファンクションキーの機能をカスタマイズします。",
      "sourceHash": "beefa476d7fda1ef681fc7fe12f3d12b334b98a2c3b5f67a8fd940d0f2ee7ffb",
      "translation": "Customize the functions of the function keys.",
      "contextHash": "beefa476d7fda1ef681fc7fe12f3d12b334b98a2c3b5f67a8fd940d0f2ee7ffb"
    },
    {
      "id": "text-002",
      "type": "text",
      "source": "前提として、ツクールＭＺの標準機能は以下の通りです。",
      "sourceHash": "02b4d8f6a2b167cbae2054fcd2e3cdf379b3ae54455e1dadce5444f26a72d87a",
      "translation": "The standard functions of RPG Maker MZ are as follows.",
      "contextHash": "02b4d8f6a2b167cbae2054fcd2e3cdf379b3ae54455e1dadce5444f26a72d87a"
    },
