      "contextHash": "fe09da81758298fceed536a7bbaa2bfdb6ccef02f8c2a084a8f6554784357195"
    },
    {
      "id": "text-003",
      "type": "text",
      "source": "これらの機能を自由に変更できます。",
      "sourceHash": "7593668e9a34da6797005ada3f159d3825066189be6d13b231cb409bf802369d",
      "translation": "You can freely change these functions.",
      "contextHash": "7593668e9a34da6797005ada3f159d3825066189be6d13b231cb409bf802369d"
    },
    {
      "id": "text-004",
      "type": "text",
      "source": "また、その他に『タイトル画面へ戻る』機能も設定できます。",
      "sourceHash": "b8f5ab6dab1dd8314435a13f3bf5706001594963a7ab66bd57321559475b592e",
      "translation": "You can also configure a “Return to Title Screen” function.",
      "contextHash": "b8f5ab6dab1dd8314435a13f3bf5706001594963a7ab66bd57321559475b592e"
    },
    {
      "id": "text-005",
      "type": "text",
      "source": "通常のリロードよりも動作が速く、ウィンドウサイズも保持されるメリットがあります。",
      "sourceHash": "3f29ea6296daffc7bdcba3729a2bfa0ea4579edb4e0a0c2f855fcf9f51a2bb7f",
      "translation": "It runs faster than a normal reload and has the advantage of preserving the window size.",
      "contextHash": "3f29ea6296daffc7bdcba3729a2bfa0ea4579edb4e0a0c2f855fcf9f51a2bb7f"
    },
    {
      "id": "text-006",
      "type": "text",
      "source": "※ただし、実行する場面によっては不具合を起こす可能性もある模様なので注意です。安定しないので使用しないほうがいいかも……。",
      "sourceHash": "4ab97f5c1af02441f6eeed84f369c4d76cbbd6fe4884ebef89eb4acae763b341",
      "translation": "※However, be careful, as it may cause problems depending on when it is executed. It may be better not to use it because it is unstable...",
      "contextHash": "4ab97f5c1af02441f6eeed84f369c4d76cbbd6fe4884ebef89eb4acae763b341"
    },
    {
      "id": "text-007",
      "type": "text",
      "source": "ver1.01よりコモンイベントの呼び出しに対応しました。２つまでコモンイベントを設定できます。",
      "sourceHash": "a6b299a41458b1a8c363197f5c94534dc9e35ded20c487c7920029405f5d3f94",
      "translation": "Support for calling common events was added in ver1.01. You can configure up to two common events.",
      "contextHash": "a6b299a41458b1a8c363197f5c94534dc9e35ded20c487c7920029405f5d3f94"
    },
    {
      "id": "text-008",
      "type": "text",
      "source": "デバッグ専用の機能にすることもできます。",
      "sourceHash": "41e3261b7d0cb9f34f98194916f515b787623c5e1f30a13b14bae14553321e7b",
      "translation": "You can also make these functions available for debugging only.",
      "contextHash": "41e3261b7d0cb9f34f98194916f515b787623c5e1f30a13b14bae14553321e7b"
    },
    {
      "id": "text-009",
      "type": "text",
      "source": "プラグインパラメータを設定しなかった箇所は元のままになります。",
      "sourceHash": "d03e111c1a0cd4ff04f1ecea7a9a4c8072e5b18ee9e25ee43d7b04906806d956",
      "translation": "Any plugin parameters you do not configure will remain unchanged.",
      "contextHash": "d03e111c1a0cd4ff04f1ecea7a9a4c8072e5b18ee9e25ee43d7b04906806d956"
    },
