    },
    {
      "id": "list-013",
      "type": "list",
      "source": "メニュー画面などから『タイトル画面へ戻る』と画面キャプチャが表示されたままになってしまう不具合修正。",
      "sourceHash": "1a5af37041be5e30fc2153400c20440e9afc5f6251c7599df82a00b63b7b7246",
      "translation": "Fixed a bug where the screen capture remained displayed when selecting “Return to Title Screen” from the menu screen or elsewhere.",
      "contextHash": "1a5af37041be5e30fc2153400c20440e9afc5f6251c7599df82a00b63b7b7246"
    },
    {
      "id": "heading-005",
      "type": "heading",
      "source": "2024/07/16（ver1.01 -> 1.011）",
      "sourceHash": "8ef2484832e262120e43ce8bc795aa57078601487cf9f56d1cdcea7903b01d0a",
      "translation": "2024/07/16 (ver1.01 -> 1.011) ",
      "contextHash": "8ef2484832e262120e43ce8bc795aa57078601487cf9f56d1cdcea7903b01d0a"
    },
    {
      "id": "list-014",
      "type": "list",
      "source": "コモンイベントの呼び出しに対応。",
      "sourceHash": "e0f2584e84e24dd5303ac75a0e4cd99e7efc8c38e8344dabb5e268cf8c51666b",
      "translation": "Added support for calling common events.",
      "contextHash": "e0f2584e84e24dd5303ac75a0e4cd99e7efc8c38e8344dabb5e268cf8c51666b"
    },
    {
      "id": "list-015",
      "type": "list",
      "source": "イベント実行中はコモンイベントを起動しないように修正。（ver1.011）",
      "sourceHash": "10be51715c1e8ef48d21bcfe6cb547a780b59dae3e311317db1e610c8be49017",
      "translation": "Fixed the plugin so that common events are not started while an event is running. (ver1.011)",
      "contextHash": "10be51715c1e8ef48d21bcfe6cb547a780b59dae3e311317db1e610c8be49017"
    },
